<div class="guide">
  <h1>How to use this app</h1>

  <p>This app keeps track of your money &thinsp;&mdash;&thinsp; what comes in, what goes out, and what is left in each account. You set it up yourself, to suit the way your business is organised.</p>
  <p>One set of books is called an <strong>entity</strong>: a business, a rental property, or simply your own household. You can keep several here, side by side, and each keeps its own accounts and its own figures.</p>
  <p>Before you start, it is worth sketching a plan: what income streams do you have, what do you spend money on, and which bank accounts and credit cards do you need to track?</p>

